<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Bimini - (built 1980) 57,708 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Grand Banks - (built 1980) 57,708 dwt sold &quot;on subjects&quot; to Greek buyers for $15.5 million enbloc.</p>
<p>Toyosu - (built 1984) 24,947 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $25 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
